          "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Hi. I ordered a pressure cooker last week, and it still hasn't arrived. It was supposed to come on Friday.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[apologetic] I am so sorry for the delay with your order [slow] K R T four seven zero nine, one three five two. Your Hawkins five-litre pressure cooker was delayed due to a backlog at the Bhiwandi sorting hub. The new delivery date is [slow] Wednesday, seven October, by nine p m via Delhivery.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"The order number is K R T four seven zero nine, one three five two.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, that is the order I am looking at right now. It is scheduled to reach you by [slow] Wednesday, seven October, by nine p m. If it does not arrive by then, you can cancel it for a full refund of two thousand three hundred forty rupees to your U P I account.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Sorry, can you give me the new delivery date once more? I'm writing it down.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Sure, it is [slow] Wednesday, seven October, by nine p m.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"And if it doesn't come by then, can I cancel and get my money back?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Yes, if it is not delivered by Wednesday, you can cancel the order. The full amount of two thousand three hundred forty rupees will be refunded to your original U P I account within five to seven working days.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Okay, thank you.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"[happy] You are very welcome. Have a wonderful day ahead, and thank you for calling Kartly!\"}]}",
